19,21 $ B. Spore Lm = 10.0-10.6; stipe surface not brunnescent; stipe large to massive; vernal and autumnal; (R. rasilispora)
20,0 $ A. Branches white to very pale yellow (cream to ivory where exposed); tips pale yellow (young) or bright greenish-yellow where unprotected; spores Lm =11.5 µm (10.8-11.9 × 3.6-4.3 µm) $ R. magnipes var. albidior
